{{External|rs|rsc=Mining training}}
{{See also|Pay-to-play Mining training}}
This [[Skill training guides|guide]] outlines the best methods for training the [[Mining]] [[skill]] in [[free-to-play]]. Even though mining [[runite ore]] with 85 Mining is one of the fastest free-to-play money making methods, profit from lower level ores is very low so it is more efficient to drop mined ores when training and use the saved time for other money making methods.

==Pickaxes==
[[Pickaxe]]s are required to train [[Mining]], ranging from [[bronze pickaxe|bronze]] to [[rune pickaxe|rune]]. Each tier up decreases the [[tick]] interval between rolls to mine an [[ore]] and thus it is recommended to always use the highest tier pickaxe available. If the [[Attack]] level requirement is met, save an inventory space by equipping the pickaxe.
